{
  "description": "Shared vectors for the MCP secret suggestion rule. The server rule (McpSecretSuggestionRule) must publish exactly `rule`, and the web matcher (which reads the rule over GraphQL) is given `rule`; both must give `expected` for every vector, so their matching stays the same. Dummy values only.",
  "rule": {
    "nameKeywords": ["KEY", "TOKEN", "SECRET", "PASSWORD", "PASS", "CREDENTIAL", "AUTH"],
